    <innerclass refid="classterminal_1_1_panes" prot="public">terminal::Panes</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespaceterminal">terminal</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Pane container that manages terminal sessions within a single tab. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_panes" kindref="compound">terminal::Panes</ref> subclasses juce::Component to provide a paned layout where one or more terminal sessions are hosted side-by-side or stacked. Each pane owns exactly one <ref refid="classterminal_1_1_display" kindref="compound">terminal::Display</ref>. The <ref refid="classValueTree" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">ValueTree</ref> hierarchy is TAB &gt; PANES &gt; PANE &gt; SESSION, owned by PaneManager and grafted into the application state tree by the owning Tab.</para>
<para>Split operations delegate to splitActive. Leaf lookup delegates to <ref refid="classjam_1_1_pane_manager_1a5318bac989d380aa730755d6b135f7f1" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">jam::PaneManager::findLeaf</ref>. Panes are owned by <ref refid="classjam_1_1_owner" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">jam::Owner&lt;PaneView&gt;</ref>; each pane&apos;s componentID is its UUID.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_display" kindref="compound">terminal::Display</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
